cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper it accompanies."
title: "Alkahest: solvent extraction and classification from chemical procedure texts"
abstract: >-
  Rule-based NLP package that extracts solvents from experimental procedure
  texts, classifies them by experimental role (reaction, workup, purification,
  analytical), maps NMR solvent mentions to canonical SMILES, and scores
  solvents with the GSK Solvent Selection Guide.
type: software
authors:
